              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Turns a stormwater result into meshes and numbers. This is the ONLY component that materialises the field — a run holds millions of values and emitting them all as a tree would freeze the canvas, so ask here for the field and the time you want.

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.12.0.827

Version 1.15.0.827

Version 1.17.0.827

