                    <chunk name="param_input" index="1">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Storm duration in MINUTES. Worth sweeping rather than guessing: a small, sealed catchment usually peaks under a short intense burst, a large or absorbent one under a longer storm, and the critical duration is whichever produces the worst result here.</item>
