                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A published percentage uplift on design rainfall. These are ALLOWANCES, not projections — nothing here downscales a climate model — and the source travels onto the Summary output so a report can cite it. Guidance is revised; check a value more than a couple of years old against your own regulator.</item>
