                    <chunk name="param_input" index="3">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Hydrologic soil group underneath. It shifts every Curve Number: the same lawn sheds far more on clay than on sand, so this is the single input here with the largest effect on the answer. B is the usual default when nothing local is known.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c95dd9d6-06c4-4c92-b4b3-ecce312a7aa2</item>
